 },
 "about": "Draws what the prompt describes - a manga panel, a new scene - with the characters exactly as in the reference picture (character sheets, joined side by side into one): the same faces, hair, clothes and colours from panel to panel. The same tested nodes as edit_picture (Kontext Q4_K_M GGUF fits an 8 GB card), but the picture is drawn on an empty canvas at the size asked for and the background is kept (no cut-out). The free route for consistent characters: Gemini's image model has no free drawing on the owner's key (429), NVIDIA's hosted Kontext takes only its example pictures (2026-11-10).",
